# CDB Final-Head Approval Binding

Native GitHub `APPROVE` is allowed only in M6 after M5 `FINAL_HEAD_READY_FOR_APPROVAL`.

## Before APPROVE

Run repo eligibility (fail-closed):

```bash
python -m tools.agent_control approval eligibility --pr <N>
```

No APPROVE when exit != 0 or recommendation != `APPROVE_RECOMMENDED`.

## Never APPROVE when

- Draft PR or `accepting_slices`
- No schema-validated Conductor handoff bound to current HEAD
- Missing hosted Required Check SUCCESS (`ci (Unit/Integration + Lint gesammelt)`,
  `policy-gate`) on exact HEAD
- Empty review body

## Roles

- `cdb_final_head_pr_approval_gate` — APPROVE only
- `cdb_final_head_merge_executor` — merge only; must not APPROVE

